# ---- credentials: never, under any circumstances, in a public repo ----
# A service-account key reads and writes everything and ignores the security
# rules. If one of these is ever committed, revoke it in the Firebase console
# immediately -- removing the commit is not enough, because it is public the
# moment it is pushed.
service_account.json
*service_account*.json
*-serviceaccount*.json
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
firebase-adminsdk*.json
